@@@ note
A blank line inside a quote keeps its '>' marker. Emitting a bare blank line would end the
quote, turning one multi-block quote into several sibling quotes. See #5.

@@@ input
> First paragraph.
>
> Second paragraph.

@@@ wrap 80
> First paragraph.
>
> Second paragraph.

@@@ wrap 20
> First paragraph.
>
> Second paragraph.

@@@ unwrap
> First paragraph.
>
> Second paragraph.
